    "No direct brain/plasma, CSF, or uptake data exist for the query molecule or for a close analogue containing the same C(C)(C)C(=O)O carboxylic acid.",
    "Efflux transporter susceptibility (P-gp/BCRP) of the query is unknown and could further reduce CNS access.",
